TITLE Albite dissolution with H2S gas at 200C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    Fe(+3) 0.004
    Fe(+2) 0.004
KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m 1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 1000 in 100
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    H2S(g) -0.30103 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -step true
    -totals Fe Na S Al
END
